{"seq":28,"slug":"ebpf-observability","title":"eBPF 可观测性编程","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability","rating":{"composite":4.22,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"ebpf-可观测性编程\">eBPF 可观测性编程</h1><p>eBPF（extended Berkeley Packet Filter）是 Linux 内核提供的可编程沙箱运行时，允许开发者在不修改内核源码、不加载内核模块的前提下，将自定义逻辑注入内核的网络、系统调用、调度器等关键路径。2026 年，eBPF 已从内核黑客的实验工具演进为云原生基础设施的标准底座——Cilium 成为 GKE、EKS、AKS 的默认或推荐 CNI，Pixie、Parca、Grafana Beyla 等项目实现了零侵入的全栈可观测性，Falco 和 Tetragon 在内核层完成实时安全检测与阻断。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦 eBPF 作为<strong>底层可编程基础设施</strong>在可观测性领域的应用。与 DevOps 工具 hub 侧重「如何使用 Prometheus/Grafana/OpenTelemetry 等上层平台」不同，本 hub 深入内核机制本身：verifier 如何保证安全、map 如何在内核态与用户态之间传递数据、程序类型如何决定挂载点与能力边界、CO-RE 如何解决跨内核版本的可移植性问题。读者完成本 hub 后，应具备自主编写生产级 eBPF 可观测性程序的能力，而非仅停留在工具使用层面。</p>\n<p><strong>前置知识要求：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Linux 系统编程基础（系统调用、进程模型、文件描述符）</li>\n<li>内核基本概念（用户态/内核态、中断、调度）</li>\n<li>C 语言基础（指针、结构体、内存布局）</li>\n<li>容器与 Kubernetes 基本概念（Pod、DaemonSet、CNI）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>第一章掌握 eBPF 架构、程序类型与数据机制（map/helper）</li>\n<li>第二章理解可观测性三大应用场景（网络、系统追踪、安全）</li>\n<li>第三章上手工具链（BCC/bpftrace 快速验证 → libbpf/CO-RE 生产开发 → Cilium/Hubble 平台集成）</li>\n<li>第四章在 Kubernetes 生产环境落地，掌握性能开销控制与生态前沿</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>延伸阅读：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>DevOps 工具与平台（05_devops-tools）——上层可观测性平台的使用与集成</li>\n<li>Linux 系统编程（01_linux-system-programming）——内核基础与系统调用深度</li>\n<li>云原生架构（32_cloud-infrastructure）——Kubernetes 网络与容器运行时</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"eBPF 基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ebpf-architecture","title":"eBPF 架构与执行模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/foundations/ebpf-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ebpf-program-types","title":"eBPF 程序类型详解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/foundations/ebpf-program-types"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ebpf-maps-helpers","title":"eBPF Map 与 Helper 函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/foundations/ebpf-maps-helpers"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"observability","title":"可观测性应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/observability","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"network-observability","title":"网络可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/observability/network-observability"},{"seq":2,"slug":"system-tracing-profiling","title":"系统追踪与性能分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/observability/system-tracing-profiling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"security-monitoring","title":"安全监控与运行时检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/observability/security-monitoring"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"toolchain","title":"工具链与开发","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/toolchain","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bcc-bpftrace","title":"BCC 与 bpftrace 快速追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/toolchain/bcc-bpftrace"},{"seq":2,"slug":"libbpf-co-re","title":"libbpf 与 CO-RE 生产级开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/toolchain/libbpf-co-re"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cilium-hubble","title":"Cilium 与 Hubble 平台级可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/toolchain/cilium-hubble"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"production","title":"生产实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/production","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ebpf-kubernetes","title":"eBPF 在 Kubernetes 中的部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/production/ebpf-kubernetes"},{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-overhead","title":"性能开销评估与优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/production/performance-overhead"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ebpf-ecosystem-future","title":"eBPF 生态系统与未来方向","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/production/ebpf-ecosystem-future"}]}]}